{"type":"message","id":"56567372","parentId":"9b6cc8d0","timestamp":"2026-05-24T16:45:58.545Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error with error code 1101. This means the API_KEY format for POST is correct (X-API-Key header), but the server has an internal error processing the request.\n\nThe GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header, but POST /send fails with 500. This could be:\n1. The server doesn't have a send endpoint implemented\n2. There's a bug in the send handler\n3. The content format expected is different\n\nLet me check if there's a different endpoint or format needed. Let me try the root endpoint to see what routes are available.","thinkingSignature":"143975cad6a0d1aced90f53ae499d2a529bd7b5352c46c7c898428a1809d2627"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jmp0pvbtp2wc_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":450,"output":185,"cacheRead":22944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23579,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779641150818,"responseId":"06625e3fd55778141823d8e850eb8388"}}
