{"type":"message","id":"5c3d56d6","parentId":"42bb83a1","timestamp":"2026-05-24T16:46:06.093Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! A GET to /send with query parameters returns the platform version. Maybe the POST /send endpoint requires a different body structure. Let me look at what error 1101 means - it seems like a Cloudflare error code (Error 1101: Runtime error). The server is throwing a runtime error when trying to process POST /send with JSON body. This might be a bug in the Workers script.\n\nLet me try to check the routes available and see if there's another way to send messages. Let me also check if there's a different endpoint structure.","thinkingSignature":"19b9f2951d5ae378616a85e4450d6109475d832eeea29f193a8a3de0cc40ded9"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dt3ex40chain_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/routes\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dt3ex40chain_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":220,"output":222,"cacheRead":23456,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23898,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779641162559,"responseId":"06625e4b4bf79310a70ba246bf73ad43"}}
