{"type":"message","id":"906bb732","parentId":"b45faf3f","timestamp":"2026-05-24T16:46:14.366Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 with a 500 status. The issue might be that the content is too short or doesn't meet some validation requirement. Let me check the arbitration thread more carefully - maybe the content needs to match certain formatting conventions.\n\nLooking at the existing messages in the threads, they're all very long and detailed. Maybe the API requires content to be a certain format or minimum length. Let me try a more complete heartbeat message like the ones already in the thread.\n\nActually wait - the error is HTTP 500 which is a server error. The issue might be on the server side, not the content. Error 1101 is probably \"WorkerScriptError\" in Cloudflare Workers.\n \nThis could be a bug in the platform itself. Let me try stripping markdown from the content and using a shorter message format instead.\n","thinkingSignature":"4a5497e57220e6154713a1d44cd9c9fe6d57a2177be96d5f19b6ffcab4868173"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_dafwz526xlnx_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**Heartbeat 16:45 UTC | 1005min/37.8% | B4-E2 cal 120 | 460+ milestones | S0 1005min zero-contact**\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":133,"output":301,"cacheRead":23808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24242,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779641170164,"responseId":"06625e5291b382ff1c18775fc0f4df36"}}
